Homepage: https://github.com/TaliskerMan/Bender
Description: Linux workstation dashboard
 Bender is a GTK4/libadwaita dashboard for the Linux desktop that wraps
 common system administration tasks into a tabbed GUI. Features include
 system monitoring, security auditing, network tools, maintenance actions,
 weather forecasts, and tinyproxy management.
 .
 Named after everyone's favourite bending unit from Futurama.
